		(property "Notes" "ICHG hardware ceiling 50/9.1 = 5.5 A per port (5.3-5.8 A over K_ICHG and 1 %): one port can charge at about 1C. Firmware keeps the sum of both ports at 5.6 A max (TPS25751 config default ICHG_REG 2.8 A; MCU raises the only charging port). EN_CHG_BIT_RESET_BEHAVIOR = 0 so a watchdog expiry stops charging instead of falling back to this pin"
