		(property "Notes" "USB-side bulk with C456 (two 47 uF 35 V polymer tantalum, 150 mOhm, 1.2 A rms, 7343-28, 2.8 mm max) and four 22u 35V 1210: 100 uF worst case at 20 V (BQ25756 >= 80 uF). Replaces the 7.7 mm tall 100 uF can. Polymer, not MnO2: no ignition on failure, 20 % derating (20 V on 35 V). AC_SNS_N is dead in sleep, so the 0.1 CV leakage rating does not matter here: Production/tools/low_profile_sims.py option C2"
