		(property "Notes" "CE pull-up to 3V3: charging is inhibited unless the MCU drives CHG_INH (DIO24) low. Reset, WDT reset, ROM bootloader or an unprogrammed MCU all inhibit (pins float). CC2340 Standby keeps the GPIO state, so a low CHG_INH keeps charging in Standby. With 3V3 down (dead pack) CE reads low, so USB can still revive the pack. MCU low through R435/R535: CE = 3.3 x 1k/48k = 0.07 V (VIL max 0.4 V)"
			(at 665.48 425.45 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
